{"id": "roofing-permit-payroll-and-state-insurance", "title": "A roofing contractor told its insurer it had no employees", "seconds": 47.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "c176cdb95d00f659", "words": 153, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The roofing contractor told its insurer it had no employees.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.16, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["No", "employees"], "sub": "One payroll declaration conflicted with another"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.42, 0.96, 1.21, 1.36, 1.85, 1.96, 2.15, 2.3]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Payroll reports sent to the state told a different story.", "t0": 3.28, "t1": 5.65, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pleas", "kicker": "One payroll declaration conflicted with another", "text": "State payroll reports", "mark": "State"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.93, 1.02, 1.13, 1.4, 1.61, 1.67, 1.94]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The employment department had records for five to six employees.", "t0": 5.77, "t1": 8.52, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "Five to six employees", "label": "One payroll declaration conflicted with another"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.51, 0.89, 1.03, 1.37, 1.52, 1.75, 1.85, 2.07]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "An injured employee then filed a claim with the state insurer.", "t0": 8.64, "t1": 11.34, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An injured employee filed a claim"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.45, 0.95, 1.14, 1.42, 1.48, 1.75, 1.88, 1.97, 2.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "San Francisco investigators checked the building permits.", "t0": 11.56, "t1": 14.06, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pleas", "kicker": "Permits and contract prices supplied independent evidence", "text": "San Francisco building permits", "mark": "San"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.72, 1.34, 1.6, 1.69, 1.99]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Property owners provided another check on the numbers.", "t0": 14.18, "t1": 16.42, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Property owners’ contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.62, 1.0, 1.29, 1.54, 1.63, 1.72]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Investigators compared contract prices with project costs reported to the insurer.", "t0": 16.54, "t1": 20.47, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pleas", "kicker": "Permits and contract prices supplied independent evidence", "text": "Owners’ contract prices", "mark": "Owners’"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.7, 1.04, 1.46, 1.83, 1.98, 2.36, 2.84, 3.24, 3.32, 3.43]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Two separate licenses connect the businesses to City permits.", "t0": 20.69, "t1": 23.66, "shot": "licenses", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "order", "layout": "table", "heading": "Two separate licenses", "context": "Licensing decision", "rows": [{"label": "Ace Roofing Co.", "value": "762924"}, {"label": "JK and Associates Construction Inc.", "value": "853861"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.6, 1.18, 1.48, 1.58, 2.06, 2.18, 2.44]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The building register lists 115 permits for Ace and 10 for the corporation.", "t0": 23.78, "t1": 27.98, "shot": "contacts", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "acebuilding", "layout": "table", "heading": "Building permit contacts", "context": "Distinct permit numbers per license", "rows": [{"label": "Ace Roofing Co.", "value": "115"}, {"label": "JK and Associates Construction Inc.", "value": "10"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.89, 1.2, 1.42, 1.68, 2.09, 