 and prosecution", "value": "$12,271.42"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.53, 0.82, 1.27, 1.58, 2.18, 2.26, 2.39, 2.55]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The records do not establish how much was collected.", "t0": 41.46, "t1": 43.83, "shot": "collection", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Collection unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.63, 0.82, 1.27, 1.41, 1.61, 1.74]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.95, "t1": 46.1, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "One payroll declaration conflicted with another", "b": "Permits and contract prices supplied independent evidence", "o": "What the judge established"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "contrast"}